The changes:
  state.go   the Reader keeps context_map_storage, dist_context_map_storage and
             context_modes_storage, and its work count and budget, which
             decoderStateInit clears
  decode.go  decodeContextMap's map and the metablock's context modes are cut
             from that storage (contextMapStorage, zeroedFrom) instead of made;
             each step budget.go counts is charged immediately before it runs,
             and a refused charge ends the stream with decoderErrorTooCostly
  reader.go  Read returns ErrTooCostly for decoderErrorTooCostly
  storage.go new: that storage, made once at the largest size the format allows
             and zeroed for each use
  budget.go  new: the work count, the budget and its check, ErrTooCostly, and
             what each counted step costs

To reproduce: `go mod download -json github.com/andybalholm/brotli@v1.2.6`
names the module's directory; the upstream checksums above are those of its
files, `gofmt` on the three listed reproduces their copies, and
`diff -u <dir>/<file> internal/brotli/<file>` shows every change.
